 <office:body><office:text>
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">An export fixture</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">This document exists to be exported. It has <text:span text:style-name="T1">bold</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="T2">italic</text:span>, a superscript x<text:span text:style-name="T3">2</text:span>, a link to <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://excelano.com/">the Excelano site</text:a>, and a footnote.<text:note text:id="ftn1" text:note-class="footnote"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p text:style-name="Footnote">The footnote says where a claim came from.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note> Some words are not Latin: Grüße, αβγ δέλτα, and Привет.</text:p>
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">Lists</text:h>
<text:list text:style-name="L1"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="P1">First bullet</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="P1">Second bullet, with a numbered list inside it</text:p><text:list><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="P1">One</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="P1">Two</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="P1">Third bullet</text:p></text:list-item></text:list>
